# Build context for THIS Dockerfile only.
#
# BuildKit uses `packages/web/Dockerfile.dockerignore` instead of the repo-root
# `.dockerignore` whenever the build is `-f packages/web/Dockerfile`. That
# matters because the root file excludes `docs/` and `*.md` to keep the API
# context small, and the web build READS those files at build time — without
# this file `virtual:docs` fails with
#   ENOENT: no such file or directory, lstat '/app/docs/guides/API_REFERENCE.md'
#
# So: keep every path docs.sources.json publishes, drop everything else heavy.

# ── Dependencies & caches ───────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/.bun/
**/.output/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# ── VCS / CI / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
.zed/

# ── Secrets & env ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Local-only, never part of a published doc ───────────────────────
# docs/adr/ and docs/features/ are fine to keep; these are not.
data/
plan/
test_reports/
.superpowers/
mastra_plan/
cinder-js/
cinder-js-gpt/

# ── Agent scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.agent/
.agents/
.gemini/
.kiro/
.windsurf/

# ── Stale compiled binaries at the repo root ────────────────────────
/api
/app
/tomoshibi-api
/tomoshibi-worker
/worker
/tomoshibi

# ── Other packages' heavyweight dirs (their sources stay) ───────────
packages/bridge/.wxt/
packages/bridge/.output/
packages/api/data/
